### TeamForge Phase 7 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Scheduler, Manual Tick, Run Log & Super User Job Monitor

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@superUserToken = Bearer YOUR_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Trigger Job Tick as Collaborator (Rejected)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "Forbidden", "message": "Forbidden - Requires superuser role." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Trigger Job Tick as Regular Admin (Rejected)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "Forbidden", "message": "Forbidden - Requires superuser role." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Trigger Job Tick as Super User (Allowed)
# Expected Status: 202 Accepted
# Expected Response: { "runId": "run-..." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Trigger Job Tick while Another Tick is Already Running (Conflict)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 409, "error": "Conflict", "code": "JOB_ALREADY_RUNNING", "message": "A job tick is already in progress.", "runId": "run-..." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. List Recent Job Runs as Collaborator (Rejected)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "Forbidden", "message": "Forbidden - Requires admin role." }
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs?limit=20
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. List Recent Job Runs as Admin (Allowed)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: Array of JobRun objects (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs?limit=20
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. List Recent Job Runs as Super User (Allowed)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs?limit=20
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. Get Single Job Run by ID (Allowed)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: Single JobRun with per-job details, itemsProcessed, errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs/run-12345
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 9. Get Single Job Run by Non-Existent ID (Rejected)
# Expected Status: 404 Not Found
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 404, "error": "Not Found", "code": "RUN_NOT_FOUND", "message": "Job run with id \"non-existent\" not found" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs/non-existent-id
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
